{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d5d4d74029cd2ab6","name":"Geonosian Industries","source":{"id":"source:reference-d5d4d74029cd2ab6","title":"Geonosian Industries","revision":23911,"timestamp":"2024-10-07T17:50:39Z","sha256":"5cd2bf165c3aae827e36d7769f14f5eb525d9aae8e5e1c07d029db6676811e44","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23911","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Geonosian%20Industries&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d5d4d74029cd2ab6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosians"}," have always felt slighted by the Republic's refusal to accept the supremacy of their Queen- despite most humanoids' lack of wings (a clear sign that the galaxy's other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," are of inferior castes). The Geonosians' archduke, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poggle the Lesser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poggle_the_Lesser?action=edit&redlink=1"},", is impressed by Count Dooku's deference toward the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian","referenceId":"reference:c188f1fd062ba0aa"}," Queen Caste, so he pledges every last one of his Species' underground factories to the Separatist cause and offers his homeworld as a meeting place for the other trade faction representatives.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosians"}," lack a formal military, their Warrior Caste is usually sufficient to deal with most criminal or security issues. As part of a hive society, the Warrior Caste is tightly organized under individual members of the Queen Caste, and require no further command structure: a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Warrior"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian_Warrior","referenceId":"reference:3ca1941c690355bb"}," serves his queen and takes orders from no one else (though Archduke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poggle the Lesser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poggle_the_Lesser?action=edit&redlink=1"}," has considerable influence over his queen, and can usually expect his requests to be commuted into orders by the queen within moments).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In battle, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Warriors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian_Warriors"}," simply throw themselves at opponents in whatever numbers they have at hand; they have no concept of squads, ranks, or orders of battle. An encounter with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian","referenceId":"reference:c188f1fd062ba0aa"}," troops might be with a handful of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Warriors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian_Warriors"},", a swarm of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Geonosian Warriors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Geonosian_Warriors"},", the reverse, or any combination in between.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Geonosian Industries Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Warrior"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian_Warrior","referenceId":"reference:3ca1941c690355bb"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Geonosian Warrior"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Geonosian_Warrior","referenceId":"reference:d8e3cf0493e399f1"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Bodyguard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian_Bodyguard","referenceId":"reference:72f1a7173b614c36"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Warrior Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosian_Warrior_Squad","referenceId":"reference:144add160eeb251f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Geonosian Warrior Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Geonosian_Warrior_Squad","referenceId":"reference:b5ac9bb1415a8b7a"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosian Bodyguard Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/